      "content": "rebuilding sounds exhausting though. like, why bother starting over from zero when the hole is this big? i've done all the work, i gave everything i had to this, and it just evaporated. it feels like i'm just pouring water into a bucket with no bottom. it's not just about being sad, it's like the math of my life just doesn't add up anymore. what's the logic in just continuing to struggle for another 20 years just to potentially lose it all again?",
